OL,3,GNEWSAShopping centre pool takes shape
OL,4,Afor clock's return
OL,5,
OL,6,FA shopping centre pool is taking shape
OL,7,Fagain, years after it was first knocked
OL,8,Fdown.
OL,10,FRestoration work is under way to bring
OL,11,Fthe eccentric Emett Clock back to its
OL,12,Foriginal position to the Victoria
OL,13,FCentre's main foyer, in Nottingham.
OL,15,FIt originally stood in a pond of water,
OL,16,Finto which people used to throw coins
OL,17,Ffor charity, but the clock and its pool
OL,18,Fwere moved to the upper floor in 2014.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
