OL,3,GNEWSAShopping centre pool takes shape
OL,4,Afor clock's return
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow four tonnes of concrete has been
OL,7,Flaid in preparation for the rebuilding
OL,8,Fof the pond, which shopping centre
OL,9,Fmanagers expect to be finished by
OL,10,FChristmas.
